menu "MxR validation (development board only)"
config MXR_TEST_CACHE_OFF
    bool "Run destructive cache-off smoke test"
    default n
    depends on MXR_IRAM_PATH_ALLOC_FAMILY && MXR_CANARY && MXR_DOUBLE_FREE_DETECT
    help
        Runs after init with SDK critical section and NMI masked.
        Intentionally corrupts a canary and repeats a free to exercise
        deferred error reporting. Use a disposable development board.
        Not suitable for production or an active Wi-Fi connection.
endmenu
